      "statement": "@[simp]\nprotected theorem repr_self [DecidableEq ι] (b : OrthonormalBasis ι 𝕜 E) (i : ι) :\n    b.repr (b i) = EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : 𝕜) := by\n  rw [← b.repr_symm_single i, LinearIsometryEquiv.apply_symm_apply]\n",
