      "id": "S-ENERGY",
      "kind": "PINNED_API_DECLARATION",
      "statement": "/-- Squared Euclidean gradient norm: `‖∇g(x)‖² = ∑ᵢ (∂g/∂xᵢ)²`. -/\nnoncomputable def gradNormSq (n : ℕ) (g : (Fin n → ℝ) → ℝ) : (Fin n → ℝ) → ℝ :=\n  fun x => ∑ i : Fin n, (partialDeriv i g x)^2\n",
